I'll analyze the recent chats quick access component and refactor it to use a reusable chat card component similar to TaskCardLite.

## 1. Analysis & Pre-Thinking

**Core Requirements:**
- Review RecentChatsQuickAccess.vue structure
- Extract chat card UI into a reusable component (ChatCard)
- Use the new ChatCard component in RecentChatsQuickAccess
- Maintain all existing functionality (search, recent chats, active state, badges, etc.)

**Strategic Approach:**
1. Create new `src/components/chat/ChatCard.vue` component with chat card UI
2. Extract the repeated chat card markup from RecentChatsQuickAccess (used in both search results and recent chats sections)
3. Replace both occurrences with the new ChatCard component
4. Pass all necessary props (chat, isActive callback, onClick handler)
5. Keep computed properties and logic in RecentChatsQuickAccess

**Dependencies & Risks:**
- ChatCard needs: chat object, isActive state, getChatProject method, badgeColor config
- Must maintain click handlers and active state styling
- Search results and recent chats share identical card structure
- All methods used by card (getInitials, getChatProject, getFormattedDate, getLastMessageSnippet) stay in parent

**Target Files:**
- Create `src/components/chat/ChatCard.vue` - New reusable chat card component
- Modify `src/components/chats/RecentChatsQuickAccess.vue` - Replace card markup with ChatCard component

---

## 2. File Changes

```vue src/components/chat/ChatCard.vue
<script setup>
import moment from 'moment'
</script>

<template>
  <div
    :class="[
      'p-3 rounded-xl border transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer flex flex-col gap-2 relative overflow-hidden',
      isActive
        ? 'bg-primary/10 border-primary/40 text-base-content shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/20'
        : 'bg-base-300/30 border-base-content/5 hover:bg-base-300/60 hover:border-base-content/10'
    ]"
    @click="onClick"
  >
    <!-- Top Row: Project context & Board & badge mode -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
        <!-- Project indicator -->
        <div
          v-if="chatProject"
          class="avatar shrink-0"
          :title="chatProject.project_name"
        >
          <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-base-300 border border-base-content/10">
            <img :src="chatProject.project_icon" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/50 truncate max-w-[150px]">
          {{ chatProject?.project_name || 'Project' }}
          <span v-if="chat.board" class="text-base-content/30 mx-1">/</span>
          <span v-if="chat.board" class="text-base-content/70 font-bold">{{ chat.board }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Mode/Badge -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
        <span
          v-if="chat.mode"
          :class="`badge badge-xs badge-outline text-[9px] px-1.5 py-1 font-semibold border-base-content/25 badge-${badgeColor[chat.mode] || 'ghost'}`"
        >
          {{ chat.mode }}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Middle Row: Chat initials, name and status dot -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0">
      <div
        class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold shrink-0 transition-all duration-200 overflow-hidden relative border border-base-content/10"
        :class="isActive
          ? 'bg-primary text-primary-content font-extrabold'
          : 'bg-base-300 text-base-content'"
      >
        {{ getInitials(chat.name) }}
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold truncate text-base-content" :title="chat.name">
          {{ chat.name || 'Unnamed Chat' }}
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-base-content-ERROR-40 font-medium">
          {{ formattedDate }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Green indicator dot for the active chat -->
      <div
        v-if="isActive"
        class="w-2 h-2 bg-success rounded-full border border-base-100 shrink-0"
      ></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row: Last Message Snippet or Match preview -->
    <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 leading-relaxed bg-base-300/20 rounded-lg p-2 border border-base-content/5 truncate">
      {{ snippet }}
    </div>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  props: {
    chat: {
      type: Object,
      required: true
    },
    isActive: {
      type: Boolean,
      default: false
    },
    chatProject: {
      type: Object,
      default: null
    },
    badgeColor: {
      type: Object,
      default: () => ({
        task: 'primary',
        chat: 'accent'
      })
    },
    snippet: {
      type: String,
      default: ''
    }
  },
  methods: {
    onClick() {
      this.$emit('select')
    },
    getInitials(name) {
      if (!name) return 'CH'
      const cleanName = name.replace(/[^\w\s-]/g, '').trim()
      const words = cleanName.split(/\s+/)
      if (words.length >= 2) {
        return (words[0][0] + words[1][0]).toUpperCase()
      }
      return name.substring(0, 2).toUpperCase()
    }
  }
}
</script>
