## Summary

✅ **Created** `ChatCard.vue` - A reusable chat card component that displays:
- Project indicator with icon
- Chat name and formatted date
- Active state styling with green indicator dot
- Mode badge (task/chat)
- Last message snippet preview

✅ **Refactored** `RecentChatsQuickAccess.vue` to:
- Import and use ChatCard component
- Eliminated duplicate card markup (previously in both search results and recent chats sections)
- Maintain all existing functionality (search, sorting, active state, click handlers)
- Cleaner and more maintainable code
